@startuml Seq_Puzzle
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
title Sequence diagram --- Solve a puzzle

actor Player
participant "Puzzle page\n(Angular)" as UI
participant "Server" as S
database "SQLite" as DB

Player -> UI : Opens /puzzles
UI -> S : GET /api/puzzles/daily
S -> DB : Load Puzzle
DB --> S : Position and solution
S --> UI : Puzzle (FEN, theme)
Player -> UI : Plays the solution on the board
UI -> S : POST /api/puzzles/:id/solve
S -> DB : Record solve
DB --> S : Stats updated
S --> UI : Puzzle solved
UI --> Player : Success
@enduml
